          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "BMS vs BBA is mostly a question of university pattern and college quality, since both are undergraduate management degrees with similar subjects, so compare the syllabus, internships, faculty and alumni outcomes of the specific college rather than the degree name."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Choose the college with a strong syllabus, practical exposure and credible alumni outcomes, and treat the BMS or BBA label as secondary."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Check official pages and avoid agents promising placement."
          }
        ]
      },
